Statement of Purpose

The laws of most jurisdictions throughout the world automatically confer exclusive Copyright and Related Rights (defined below) upon the creator and subsequent owner(s) of an original work of authorship.

A person who assents to this document's license, referred to as "Affirmer," elects to abandon all Copyright and Related Rights in a work, known as the "Work," and dedicates the Work to the public domain.

You may copy, modify, distribute, and perform the Work, even for commercial purposes, all without asking permission.

For more information, see https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
